cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this deposit, please cite it as below."
title: "DTCR: reference implementation, frozen protocol and software-in-the-loop evaluation of a digital-twin cyber-resilience framework"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the digital-twin cyber-resilience (DTCR) framework,
  a frozen pre-registered experimental protocol for the UMSF laboratory cyber
  range, and a 1296-run software-in-the-loop confirmatory campaign that verifies
  the implementation and documents ten reproducible defects in the corresponding
  manuscript. The physical cyber-range campaign has NOT been executed: all
  deposited runs carry data_origin = simulation and none of them measures physical
  hardware.
type: software
